@ 371 S14a ORDER BY, LIMIT, OFFSET
value staging.payments.order_id -> mart.top_customers.customer_id identity
value staging.payments.amount -> mart.top_customers.revenue identity
filter staging.payments.status, staging.payments.amount, staging.payments.paid_at -> mart.top_customers
note D-9: amount and paid_at order a LIMIT, so they decide which rows land.

@ 385 S14b FETCH FIRST WITH TIES
