forbid influence staging.inventory_snapshots.reserved -> mart.sales_daily.units | the order rows are inserted in changes no value

@ 411 S14d LIMIT with no ORDER BY
value core.dim_date.calendar_date -> mart.sales_daily.sale_date identity
forbid filter core.dim_date.calendar_date -> mart.sales_daily | a LIMIT with no ORDER BY keeps arbitrary rows; no column decides which (D-9)

